{"text": "[curious] Two employees. A dozen AI tools. 1.8 BILLION dollars.\n[deadpan] That's nine hundred million each... my performance review went quiet.\nApril second, The New York Times profiles Medvi, a weight-loss telehealth startup run by the Gallagher brothers.\nSam Altman's friends literally bet this day would come.\nFootnote one: it's projected SALES, not valuation.\n[serious] Rewind.\nSix weeks BEFORE that profile, an FDA warning letter to Medvi was already dated.\nThe charge: MISBRANDED compounded semaglutide and tirzepatide.\nIn 2025, Futurism reported allegedly fake patients and deepfake before-and-afters.\nPlus several federal lawsuits.\nMedvi says that letter targeted an affiliate marketer's outdated website.\nAllegations, not verdicts.\n[dramatic] The twist? Nine days later, the Times itself added an Editors' Note: that letter belonged in the story.\n[deadpan] Two employees, a dozen AI tools... one very long footnote.\nSo is the one-person billion-dollar company real? We checked the receipts. Linked below.", "model": "eleven_v3", "voice": "8Ln42OXYupYsag45MAUy", "alignment": {"characters": ["[", "c", "u", "r", "i", "o", "u", "s", "]", " ", "T", "w", "o", " ", "e", "m", "p", "l", "o", "y", "e", "e", "s", ".", " ", "A", " ", "d", "o", "z", "e", "n", " ", "A", "I", " ", "t", "o", "o", "l", "s", ".", " ", "1", ".", "8", " ", "B", "I", "L", "L", "I", "O", "N", " ", "d", "o", "l", "l", "a", "r", "s", ".", "\n", "[", "d", "e", "a", "d", "p", "a", "n", "]", " ", "T", "h", "a", "t", "'", "s", " ", "n", "i", "n", "e", " ", "h", "u", "n", "d", "r", "e", "d", " ", "m", "i", "l", "l", "i", "o", "n", " ", "e", "a", "c", "h", ".", ".", ".", " ", "m", "y", " ", "p", "e", "r", "f", "o", "r", "m", "a", "n", "c", "e", " ", "r", "e", "v", "i", "e", "w", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "q", "u", "i", "e", "t", ".", "\n", "A", "p", "r", "i", "l", " ", "s", "e", "c", "o", "n", "d", ",", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "N", "e", "w", " ", "Y", "o", "r", "k", " ", "T", "i", "m", "e",